# TypeScript

- Imports without `.js` extension
- Functions: `export const fn = () => {}`
- `interface` for object shapes; `type` only for unions/indexed access
- Feature folders: `model.ts`, `types.ts`, `index.ts` (public API)
- Constants in `constants.ts`, not magic strings

See `skills/rules/02-typescript.md`.
